      "en": "This coursework evaluates how a learner explains, analyses and demonstrates selecting trading instruments by volatility, liquidity and cost using objective chart evidence, explicit invalidation and controlled risk.",
      "zh": "本课程作业评估学习者如何运用客观图表证据、明确失效条件与受控风险来解释、分析并展示按波动性、流动性与成本选择交易品种。"
    },
